WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:02:26.791 --> 00:02:28.750
Rich Paul is probably best known as

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:30.916
LeBron James' agent and the founder

00:02:30.916 --> 00:02:34.041
of Klutch sports. In August, 2019,

00:02:34.041 --> 00:02:36.000
when the NCAA announced a

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:37.875
bachelor's degree would be required

00:02:37.875 --> 00:02:39.916
for agents to represent student

00:02:39.958 --> 00:02:42.166
athletes testing the NBA draft,

00:02:42.250 --> 00:02:44.291
Paul decided to take a stand against the

00:02:44.291 --> 00:02:47.041
rule that directly disempowered athletes

00:02:47.125 --> 00:02:50.250
and created barriers for black NBA agents.

00:02:50.458 --> 00:02:52.041
You see, Paul does not have a

00:02:52.041 --> 00:02:53.833
bachelor's degree, but he represents

00:02:53.833 --> 00:02:56.500
several high profile NBA names like

00:02:56.666 --> 00:02:59.458
LeBron,  Anthony Davis and Ben Simmons.

00:02:59.541 --> 00:03:01.541
The 39 year old's philosophy is

00:03:01.541 --> 00:03:03.625
rooted in athlete empowerment, 

00:03:03.625 --> 00:03:05.583
a threat to establishments on both

00:03:05.583 --> 00:03:07.583
the professional and amateur level.

00:03:07.791 --> 00:03:09.333
Paul believes in offering more

00:03:09.333 --> 00:03:11.041
options to athletes and did so

00:03:11.041 --> 00:03:12.625
in the case of the Oklahoma City

00:03:12.666 --> 00:03:15.083
Thunder's Darius Bazley in 2018. 

00:03:15.333 --> 00:03:18.250
Bazley hired Rich Paul in May, 2018

00:03:18.291 --> 00:03:20.125
after initially signing a letter of

00:03:20.125 --> 00:03:22.541
intent to join Syracuse in November,

00:03:22.541 --> 00:03:24.958
2017. Bazley was then hired for a

00:03:24.958 --> 00:03:27.000
three month internship at New Balance

00:03:27.291 --> 00:03:29.208
which paid him a million dollars and

00:03:29.208 --> 00:03:31.458
provided him with training resources

00:03:31.500 --> 00:03:32.833
as he prepared for the draft.

00:03:32.875 --> 00:03:34.958
Bazley was selected in the first round

00:03:34.958 --> 00:03:38.500
of the 2019 NBA draft by the Utah Jazz and

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:40.541
traded to the Thunder shortly thereafter.

00:03:40.583 --> 00:03:42.833
This obviously ruffled feathers in the NCAA

00:03:42.833 --> 00:03:44.500
and the new rule appeared to be

00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:47.041
a response to Paul and agents

00:03:47.041 --> 00:03:48.958
who look to do the same in the future.

00:03:48.958 --> 00:03:50.750
Hence why LeBron James dubbed it,

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:52.041
"The Rich Paul Rule." 

00:03:52.041 --> 00:03:53.583
Paul's ability to create more 

00:03:53.583 --> 00:03:55.291
avenues for his clients was considered

00:03:55.291 --> 00:03:57.875
a disruptor to the NCAA system.

00:03:57.875 --> 00:03:59.708
A college degree wasn't necessary

00:03:59.708 --> 00:04:01.583
for an agent until that point,

00:04:01.625 --> 00:04:04.166
some allege, because the NCAA

00:04:04.208 --> 00:04:06.541
realized Rich Paul didn't have one.

00:04:06.791 --> 00:04:08.875
After significant backlash from

00:04:08.875 --> 00:04:11.083
the public and likes of Chris Paul,

00:04:11.083 --> 00:04:13.541
Kevin Hart, LeBron James and others,

00:04:13.833 --> 00:04:16.291
the NCAA later amended the rule.

00:04:16.375 --> 00:04:18.166
And while Rich Paul was able to

00:04:18.166 --> 00:04:19.791
continue representing athletes

00:04:19.791 --> 00:04:21.583
his own way, it was clear

00:04:21.583 --> 00:04:23.541
he played a pivotal role in

00:04:23.541 --> 00:04:25.375
shifting the power dynamic between

00:04:25.500 --> 00:04:28.041
black athletes, black agents and

00:04:28.041 --> 00:04:29.625
institutions for years to come.

